# ⚠️ The build context is the **repository root** (see deploy/Dockerfile), so this file is what keeps a machine's
# state out of the image. Everything excluded here is either installed inside the image or is data that must only
# ever arrive as a mounted volume.
node_modules/
.venv/
.git/
.gitignore
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# ⚠️ **Machine state, and the reason the exclusion matters is not size.** `store/` and `output/` are mounted as
# volumes at run time; baking a copy into the image would freeze one machine's history — and would give the
# container an `output/` missing the `.published-<lang>.json` records that the volume exists to preserve, which is
# one re-upload away from posting the same brief twice.
store/
output/
resource/
var/
credentials/
.config/

# Not needed to build. `remotion/fonts/` is **not** excluded — the vendored face is source, not an asset.
docs/
tests/
public/
remotion-out/
.remotion/
